Golang LoadBalancer in Brainfuck

The whole load balancer state machine lives on this tape
loadbalancer dot go feeds it one event per byte on stdin and carries out the
commands it prints one per line until an empty line

  r     a request arrived  answers proxy or log and the request metrics
  t     the health check ticker fired  answers one get line per backend to probe
  h     followed by one line per probed backend  the StatusCode from the JSON body
        or ! when the request failed or ? and the error when the body was unreadable
        answers the metric updates and the new list of healthy backends

tape  pen helper event char ok len idx k found count
      then per server  up downcount incooldown cooldownticks wentdown healthy
      then temps and the number printer workspace

the pen rests on a newline between lines
